{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"周炜良定理"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“周炜良定理”"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>$\\mathbb P^n$ 的紧复子流形是若干齐次多项式的公共零点集.</p>\n<p>见"},{"Local":{"url":"复流形","text":"复流形"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"代数簇","text":"代数簇"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}